flowchart TD
    Start([Start]) --> Try[Try Block: Execute Code]
    Try --> Error{Exception Occurred?}
    
    Error -- Yes --> Catch[Except Block: Handle Error]
    Error -- No --> Else[Else Block: Run if Success]
    
    Catch --> Finally[Finally Block: Cleanup]
    Else --> Finally
    
    Finally --> End([End / Continue])
    
    style Try fill:#d4f1f4,stroke:#333
    style Catch fill:#f8d7da,stroke:#333
    style Else fill:#d1e7dd,stroke:#333
    style Finally fill:#fff3cd,stroke:#333